<title>TURKEY: Turkish F-16 jet crashes in western Turkey.</title>
<headline>Turkish F-16 jet crashes in western Turkey.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Turkish F-16 warplane crashed on Friday in western Turkey, Anatolian news agency said.</p>
<p>The plane crashed in Kutahya province after it took off from a military airport in nearby Eskisehir, it said. There was no immediate information on casualties or a cause of the crash.</p>
